    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 900px&quot;
    alt=&quot;Oil painting on linen of three bright orange monarch butterflies tethered by thin strings to a red sledgehammer, appearing to lift it into the air against a soft cream background.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;
  &gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Docile by kyle parker cunningham&lt;&#x2F;figcaption&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;figure&gt;
</description>
